Z||000005||DaRkLoRD||09-11-2000||09:19 AM||||I can't wait to get my photos developed...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I was handing out Fiero cards, and was hoping someone would recognize them and introduce themself as a forum member... but no luck! I guess I didn't talk to enough people.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Regarding the bottom photo, of the 2 black SEs.. the one in the foreground belongs to the guy I was talking to about getting a new set of wheels!!<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||1
